  "description": "YITAMOTOR headlights and taillights set, which you can quickly match the set, without worrying about the product not matching or not being able to buy matching products.\nFitment\n2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 1500\n2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 1500HD\n2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 2500\n2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 2500HD\n2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 3500\n2007 Chevy Silverado Classic\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nPlug-n-play, does not need extra wiring\nComes with clear instructions for easy assembly and just direct bolt-on replacement for your original headlights without complex wiring.\nSealed design, dustproof & Waterproof\nThe light cover & housing are fully-sealed structures to prevent moisture or dust from entering the inside for longer service life.\nOne-way vents design, effective anti-fog\nVent design prevents the light lens from misting and avoids water seepage for stronger weather ability.\nImpact-resistant housing\nSuperior housing with cooling tubes features strong thermal stability and impact resistance, more durable than other low-quality ones that are easily melted from the factory bulbs.\nClear polycarbonate lenses to increase visibility\nThe superior lens features good transmission, high toughness, and excellent UV resistance to prevent yellowing & cracking. Micro-prism reflector alerts oncoming cars to notice you at night.",
